WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.564 --> 00:00:15.645
flew through the air, carrying the heavy vehicles.

2
00:00:15.665 --> 00:00:18.586
"Wow!" yelled someone on the ground.

3
00:00:18.606 --> 00:00:21.207
"Rocket Girl is holding a bus!"

4
00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:23.468
"And a taxi too!"

5
00:00:23.889 --> 00:00:24.649
said someone else.

6
00:00:25.729 --> 00:00:27.430
Roxy found a safe, quiet street.

7
00:00:31.051 --> 00:00:32.152
She put down the vehicles.

8
00:00:34.732 --> 00:00:36.332
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:36.593 --> 00:00:37.553
said a woman on the bus.

10
00:00:37.573 --> 00:00:40.574
"You're my hero, Rocket Girl!"

11
00:00:40.894 --> 00:00:41.894
said the taxi driver.

12
00:00:41.914 --> 00:00:43.915
"No problem, folks!"

13
00:00:44.275 --> 00:00:44.975
said Roxy.

14
00:00:46.215 --> 00:00:48.436
Roxy blasted off and headed back to West Street.

15
00:00:49.836 --> 00:00:51.377
Snow was still swirling everywhere.

16
00:00:52.237 --> 00:00:55.078
The wind was blowing strong, and deep snowdrifts were forming.

17
00:00:56.198 --> 00:00:58.119
"I've never seen a blizzard this bad!"

18
00:00:58.359 --> 00:00:59.059
thought Roxy.

19
00:01:00.479 --> 00:01:03.020
She saw two police cars half buried under the snow.

20
00:01:04.068 --> 00:01:06.229
Some police officers were trying to dig them out.

21
00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.611
"Which way did Weatherman go?"

22
00:01:09.991 --> 00:01:11.511
Roxy called to the police officers.

23
00:01:11.531 --> 00:01:16.994
"He went that way, toward the mountains," yelled one officer.

24
00:01:18.354 --> 00:01:21.536
Roxy zoomed after the villain, following the van's tracks in the snow.

25
00:01:23.237 --> 00:01:24.257
The wind was howling.

26
00:01:26.078 --> 00:01:28.339
Snow blew everywhere, covering the van's tracks.

27
00:01:29.559 --> 00:01:32.116
Roxy used her super vision.

28
00:01:32.136 --> 00:01:34.957
Far ahead she could see faint lights through the thick falling snow.

29
00:01:34.977 --> 00:01:37.258
"There he is!"

30
00:01:37.498 --> 00:01:37.919
she said.

31
00:01:37.939 --> 00:01:41.160
"Now it's time to put a stop to this villain!"

32
00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.881
Roxy soon caught up to the van.

33
00:01:44.741 --> 00:01:46.282
She took a deep, deep breath.

34
00:01:47.042 --> 00:01:50.144
Then Whoo-ooo-oosh!

35
00:01:51.064 --> 00:01:52.625
Roxy blew as hard as she could.

36
00:01:53.565 --> 00:01:55.266
She let out a powerful gust of wind.

37
00:01:56.246 --> 00:01:58.867
A huge snowdrift formed in front of Weatherman's van.

38
00:02:00.844 --> 00:02:02.925
Boomph! The van slammed into the snowdrift.

39
00:02:05.066 --> 00:02:07.228
"I'll get you for that, Rocket Girl!"

40
00:02:07.508 --> 00:02:08.388
shouted Weatherman.

41
00:02:09.269 --> 00:02:11.370
He jumped out of the van and held up a Weather Ball.

42
00:02:12.230 --> 00:02:15.372
He was just about to throw it when—whiz-hoo!

43
00:02:16.373 --> 00:02:19.194
Roxy blasted the ball to pieces with her eye laser beams.

44
00:02:22.256 --> 00:02:25.117
"You won't be creating any more bad weather today!"

45
00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:26.098
said Roxy.

46
00:02:26.118 --> 00:02:29.440
"You're going to jail, Weatherman!"

47
00:02:30.496 --> 00:02:32.517
"Agh!" said Weatherman.

48
00:02:32.537 --> 00:02:36.219
"This is so much fun!"

49
00:02:36.519 --> 00:02:37.079
said Jack.

50
00:02:37.099 --> 00:02:39.560
"I can't believe it snowed!"

51
00:02:40.941 --> 00:02:44.222
Jack, Mara, and Terrell were making a snowman in Terrell's backyard.

52
00:02:44.242 --> 00:02:49.705
"I wonder when Roxy will be back," said Terrell.

53
00:02:49.725 --> 00:02:52.506
"She's been gone a long time."

54
00:02:52.526 --> 00:02:54.927
"Yeah," said Mara.

55
00:02:54.947 --> 00:02:57.248
"She's missing all the fun!"

56
00:02:58.560 --> 00:02:59.301
"Here I am!"

57
00:02:59.581 --> 00:03:01.444
called Roxy as she ran into the yard.

58
00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:05.008
"I'm so surprised that it snowed."

59
00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.493
Terrell looked at Roxy suspiciously.

60
00:03:08.513 --> 00:03:13.319
"I wonder if Rocket Girl had something to do with it," he said.

61
00:03:13.339 --> 00:03:15.461
"Who knows?"

62
00:03:15.942 --> 00:03:17.344
said Roxy with a smile.
